# Trained models are generated output -- regenerate them with the scripts
# in model/training/ rather than committing binaries.
#
# The artifacts previously committed here were saved with scikit-learn
# 0.24 and no longer load on scikit-learn 1.x. They remain recoverable
# from git history if ever needed:
#   git checkout 77c2fd1 -- model/artifacts/final_expense_model.pkl
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.json
!.gitignore
